						<r3d:remarks>XNAT CENTRAL is a publicly accessible datasharing portal at Washinton University Medical School using XNAT software. XNAT provides neuroimaging data through a web interface and a customizable open source platform.  XNAT facilitates data uploads and downloads for data sharing, processing and organization. Currently, XNAT is working with the Human Connectome Project and the Cancer Imaging Archive on each project&#039;s data sharing needs, and is the backbone of a publicly available imaging resource at XNAT Central.
Wiki:  https://wiki.xnat.org/documentation</r3d:remarks>
